# Pioneer PGD

> Certifying plumber, gasfitter and drainlayer in Upper Hutt, serving the Greater Wellington region.

Pioneer PGD is a locally owned and operated plumbing, gasfitting and drainlaying company based in Trentham, Upper Hutt. We hold certifying licences for all three trades — the highest level issued in New Zealand.

## Services

- Plumbing: general plumbing, hot water cylinders, leak repairs
- Gasfitting: gas installation, gas leak detection, gas appliance servicing
- Drainlaying: blocked drains, CCTV drain inspection, stormwater and sewer, soak pits, drain repairs
- Lifestyle block water supply and wastewater systems

